{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Black share",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of residents who are Black or African American alone, pale to deep green. Measured over all 5,806,512 blocks with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 1%/5%/15%/35%/65%, which fall at the 59th/70th/82nd/91st/95th percentile of the national distribution. 28.97% have no published value and draw in neutral gray rather than as a low value.",
